      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Entonces habló el príncipe Hordedef. «Majestad, conozco a un mago que vive hoy.»",
          "en": "Then Prince Hordedef spoke. \"Majesty, I know a magician who is alive today.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "«Se llama Djedi. Tiene ciento diez años.»",
          "en": "\"His name is Djedi. He is one hundred and ten years old.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "«Cada día come quinientos panes y bebe cien jarras de cerveza.»",
          "en": "\"Every day he eats five hundred loaves of bread and drinks a hundred jugs of beer.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "«Puede pegar de nuevo una cabeza cortada, y hace que un león salvaje lo siga.»",
          "en": "\"He can put a cut-off head back on its body, and he can make a wild lion follow him.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "«Incluso conoce las cámaras secretas del templo de Thoth.» Khufu las quería para su pirámide. «¡Tráelo!»",
          "en": "\"He even knows the secret rooms of Thoth's temple.\" Khufu wanted them for his pyramid. \"Bring him!\" he said."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hordedef navegó río arriba y halló a Djedi tendido en una estera junto a su puerta, con sirvientes que le frotaban los pies.",
          "en": "Hordedef sailed up the river and found Djedi lying on a mat by his door, with servants rubbing his feet."
        }
      ],
